<title>HONG KONG: Pak Fah Yeow interim net rises 63 pct.</title>
<headline>Pak Fah Yeow interim net rises 63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.1  vs 7.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0   vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    15.69 vs 9.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		     43.62 vs 35.56</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pak Fah Yeow International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 30 to October 4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Pak Fah Yeow is a medicated oil manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
